---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="section env" id="env-files">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">The .env problem</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Your keys are everywhere.<br />
        <span class="serif gradient-text">Put them back in one place.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        Most leaks are not hacks. They are a key pasted into the wrong channel,
        or a .env that got committed by accident. Yily gives every secret one
        home, so there is nothing left to scatter.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="split" data-reveal-group>
      <article class="split-card before" data-reveal>
        <div class="split-head">
          <span class="split-icon is-before"><Icon name="x" size={15} /></span>
          <span class="split-label">Without Yily</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="split-list">
          <li><span class="li-ico is-before"><Icon name="x" size={10} /></span>A .env on every machine</li>
          <li><span class="li-ico is-before"><Icon name="x" size={10} /></span>Keys pasted into Slack, tickets and CI logs</li>
          <li><span class="li-ico is-before"><Icon name="x" size={10} /></span>One careless git push, and it is public forever</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="split-card after" data-reveal>
        <div class="split-head">
          <span class="split-icon is-after"><Icon name="check" size={15} /></span>
          <span class="split-label">With Yily</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="split-list">
          <li><span class="li-ico is-after"><Icon name="check" size={10} /></span>One self-hosted home for every key</li>
          <li><span class="li-ico is-after"><Icon name="check" size={10} /></span>Values pulled at boot, never copied around</li>
          <li><span class="li-ico is-after"><Icon name="check" size={10} /></span>Plaintext lives in memory only, never on disk</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="env-closer" data-reveal>
      A leaked key is gone forever. A revocable token is not. Yily makes sure
      the only thing you ever share is a token.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .env {
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 500px at 50% 0%, rgba(131, 56, 236, 0.055), transparent 70%);
  }

  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .split-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.006)),
      var(--bg-raised);
  }

  .split-card.after {
    border-color: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.16);
    background:
      radial-gradient(500px 240px at 50% 0%, rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.06), transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.006)),
      var(--bg-raised);
  }

  .split-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .split-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .split-icon.is-before {
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);
    background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.08);
    color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.85);
  }

  .split-icon.is-after {
    border: 1px solid rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.22);
    background: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.09);
    color: var(--success);
  }

  .split-label {
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .split-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .split-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .li-ico {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .li-ico.is-before {
    background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
    color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.75);
  }

  .li-ico.is-after {
    background: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.12);
    color: var(--success);
  }

  .env-closer {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 1.4rem auto 0;
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .env-closer {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
